      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773589504430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Transaction:\n{\n   id: uuid\n   date: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code: string\n   description: string\n   amount: integer\n   account_code: string\n   transfer_account_code?: string\n   created_at: ISO8601 timestamp (2026-03-14T15:23:11Z)\n   updated_at: ISO8601 timestamp\n}\n\nTransactionCreate:\n{\n   date: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code: string\n   description: string\n   amount: integer\n   account: string\n   is_transfer: bool\n   account_transfer?: string\n}\n\nTransactionUpdate:\n{\n   date?: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code?: string\n   description?: string\n   amount?: integer\n   account?: string\n   is_transfer?: bool\n   account_transfer?: string\n}\n\nGET /transactions - Lists all transactions (pagination + sort + filtering)\nExample params: \n   ?limit=200\n   &offset=200\n   &sort=-date\n   &account_code=accountCode1,accountCode2\n   &description=apple,banana,orange //backend will OR LIKE '%<word>%' all\n   &min_amount=100\n   &max_amount=1000\n   &from_date=2025-01-01\n   &to_date=2025-12-31\nResponse 200:\n{ transactions: [Transaction]\n   pagination: {\n      limit: integer\n      offset: integer\n      total: integer\n    }\n\nGET /transactions/<id> - Returns data from a single transaction\nResponse 200:\n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }\n\nPOST /transactions - Create a new transaction (transfer or otherwise)\nRequest body:\n{TransactionCreate}\nResponse 201:\n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 400:\n{ error: { code: \"invalid_XXX\" } }\n\nPOST /transactions/bulk - Creates many transactions\nRequest body:\n{ transactions: [TransactionCreate] }\nResponse 201:\n{ transactions: [Transaction] }\nResponse 400:\n{ error: { code: \"invalid_XXX\" } }\n\nPATCH /transactions/<id> - Edits an existing transaction\nResponse body:\n{TransactionUpdate}\nResponse 200: \n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }\n\nDELETE /transactions/<id> - (hard) Deletes a transaction\nResponse 204: \n<nothing>\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transaction:\n{\n   id: uuid\n   date: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code: string\n   description: string\n   amount: integer\n   account_code: string\n   transfer_account_code?: string\n   created_at: ISO8601 timestamp (2026-03-14T15:23:11Z)\n   updated_at: ISO8601 timestamp\n}\n\nTransactionCreate:\n{\n   date: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code: string\n   description: string\n   amount: integer\n   account: string\n   is_transfer: bool\n   account_transfer?: string\n}\n\nTransactionUpdate:\n{\n   date?: yyyy-MM-dd date\n   category_code?: string\n   description?: string\n   amount?: integer\n   account?: string\n   is_transfer?: bool\n   account_transfer?: string\n}\n\nGET /transactions - Lists all transactions (pagination + sort + filtering)\nExample params: \n   ?limit=200\n   &offset=200\n   &sort=-date\n   &account_code=accountCode1,accountCode2\n   &description=apple,banana,orange //backend will OR LIKE '%<word>%' all\n   &min_amount=100\n   &max_amount=1000\n   &from_date=2025-01-01\n   &to_date=2025-12-31\nResponse 200:\n{ transactions: [Transaction]\n   pagination: {\n      limit: integer\n      offset: integer\n      total: integer\n    }\n\nGET /transactions/<id> - Returns data from a single transaction\nResponse 200:\n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }\n\nPOST /transactions - Create a new transaction (transfer or otherwise)\nRequest body:\n{TransactionCreate}\nResponse 201:\n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 400:\n{ error: { code: \"invalid_XXX\" } }\n\nPOST /transactions/bulk - Creates many transactions\nRequest body:\n{ transactions: [TransactionCreate] }\nResponse 201:\n{ transactions: [Transaction] }\nResponse 400:\n{ error: { code: \"invalid_XXX\" } }\n\nPATCH /transactions/<id> - Edits an existing transaction\nResponse body:\n{TransactionUpdate}\nResponse 200: \n{ transaction: {Transaction} }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }\n\nDELETE /transactions/<id> - (hard) Deletes a transaction\nResponse 204: \n<nothing>\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"transaction_not_found\" } }",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
