      "updated": 1773458342240,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AccountBalance: \n{\n    account_code: string\n    balance: integer\n}\n\nCategoryMonthlyBalance:\n{\n    category_code: string\n    month: integer (1-12)\n    year: integer\n    balance: integer\n}\n\nYearlyBalance:\n{\n    balances: [CategoryMonthlyBalance]\n}\n\nGET /reports/yearly?year=<year> (no query param = current year)\nResponse 200:\n{ YearlyBalance} (empty array when no data)\n\nGET /reports/balance\n     ?account_code=<code> (no param = all accounts)\n      &date=<date> (balance at that specific date)\nResponse 200:\n{ accounts: [AccountBalance] }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"account_not_found\" } } ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AccountBalance: \n{\n    account_code: string\n    balance: integer\n}\n\nCategoryMonthlyBalance:\n{\n    category_code: string\n    month: integer (1-12)\n    year: integer\n    balance: integer\n}\n\nYearlyBalance:\n{\n    balances: [CategoryMonthlyBalance]\n}\n\nGET /reports/yearly?year=<year> (no query param = current year)\nResponse 200:\n{ YearlyBalance} (empty array when no data)\n\nGET /reports/balance\n     ?account_code=<code> (no param = all accounts)\n      &date=<date> (balance at that specific date)\nResponse 200:\n{ accounts: [AccountBalance] }\nResponse 404:\n{ error: { code: \"account_not_found\" } } ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
